1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,000
Το Plex ζήτησε 120€ για να συνεχίσετε να βλέπετε από τις συσκευές σας.
Το πλήρωσα εγώ το ποσό.

2
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:10,000
Αν χρησιμοποιείτε συχνά και μπορείτε,
 οποιαδήποτε συμβολή θα εκτιμηθεί.

3
00:00:06,980 --> 00:00:10,560
Did we really need to bother
with all this, Mr. Dongsuk?

4
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:12,740
We could've just killed them.

5
00:00:13,450 --> 00:00:15,350
What are you, dense?

6
00:00:15,350 --> 00:00:19,210
We fight in there, and the spider
wakes up? No more mana crystals.

7
00:00:19,630 --> 00:00:22,560
I don't care if he's the
weakest or the bleakest,

8
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:25,810
there's no way that wimpy piece of crap
and a D-Rank with no raid experience

9
00:00:25,810 --> 00:00:27,420
can take a boss down.

10
00:00:27,420 --> 00:00:32,420
The spider eats them, it goes back to sleep,
and then we haul out the mana crystals.

11
00:00:32,900 --> 00:00:35,180
Should I light the place up with magic again?

12
00:00:35,180 --> 00:00:37,760
That would also wake the spider up!

13
00:00:39,620 --> 00:00:43,630
There were side tunnels near the ceiling.
That's where we'll drop back down.

14
00:00:44,190 --> 00:00:47,730
I get it. Nice plan, Mr. Dongsuk.

15
00:00:47,730 --> 00:00:49,580
You think it'll be asleep, though?

16
00:00:49,580 --> 00:00:52,910
If not, we'll have to take
the boss down ourselves.

17
00:00:52,910 --> 00:00:56,960
Though, that Yoo Jinho kid...
You saw his gear, right?

18
00:00:56,960 --> 00:00:59,730
The sword and shield alone must
be worth hundreds of millions.

19
00:00:59,730 --> 00:01:03,920
If we can't grab enough mana crystals,
his stuff will have to do.

20
00:01:04,470 --> 00:01:07,520
Better find out whose trust fund kid he is.

21
00:01:07,520 --> 00:01:10,200
It'd look bad if I didn't show at the funeral.

22
00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:14,590
Gotta say, that was a hell of a noise
when the entrance caved in.

23
00:01:14,590 --> 00:01:17,140
The boss has gotta be pissed.

24
00:01:17,750 --> 00:01:21,980
Kyuhwan, do you think you could take
that nasty bastard down yourself?

25
00:01:21,980 --> 00:01:24,750
Not at all!

26
00:01:24,750 --> 00:01:29,190
I'm right there with you.
It was a pretty impressive boss.

27
00:01:31,210 --> 00:01:37,540
Which means those two little twerps
have absolutely no chance of surviving.

28
00:01:38,090 --> 00:01:42,240
Hang on! You'd need to be at least B-Rank
to take down a C-Rank boss by yourself.

29
00:01:42,240 --> 00:01:45,440
Or an upper C-Rank, at the very minimum!

30
00:01:45,440 --> 00:01:47,140
You've got no chance, Jinwoo...

31
00:01:48,340 --> 00:01:50,260
Let's try and find a way out instead!

32
00:01:51,120 --> 00:01:57,970
<i>Jinho is right. I may have reawakened
and leveled up, but I'm still weak.</i>

33
00:01:58,900 --> 00:02:03,980
<i>The Blue Venom-Fanged Kasaka I ran into
in the instance dungeon was probably D-Rank,</i>

34
00:02:04,950 --> 00:02:07,820
<i>and that golem boss was
probably D-Rank or lower.</i>

35
00:02:09,360 --> 00:02:14,000
<i>This boss is guaranteed to be
a lot stronger than either of them.</i>

36
00:02:15,130 --> 00:02:20,040
<i>But for some reason... I don't feel
intimidated enough to give up.</i>

37
00:02:21,040 --> 00:02:25,670
<i>I've gotten strong enough to stand
my ground against a C-Rank boss.</i>

38
00:02:27,310 --> 00:02:29,340
<i>I'm level 18 now.</i>

39
00:02:31,790 --> 00:02:33,590
<i>Taking on a C-Rank boss...</i>

40
00:02:35,820 --> 00:02:37,260
<i>is worth a shot!</i>

41
00:02:42,170 --> 00:02:44,890
<i>We're called hunters for a reason.</i>

42
00:02:46,090 --> 00:02:48,680
<i>And the real hunt begins now!</i>

43
00:04:28,250 --> 00:04:29,680
Another long day, sir.

44
00:04:30,540 --> 00:04:32,960
The government, the media,

45
00:04:32,960 --> 00:04:34,980
organizations related to energy development...

46
00:04:34,980 --> 00:04:38,470
These nonstop meetings
are beginning to wear on me.

47
00:04:39,250 --> 00:04:42,910
I was never much of a talker
in the first place.

48
00:04:46,610 --> 00:04:49,780
Your schedule is clear for the time being.

49
00:04:50,310 --> 00:04:54,190
Would it be all right if I asked
for a bit of instruction?

50
00:04:54,550 --> 00:04:57,400
It might be the change of pace you need, too.

51
00:05:00,350 --> 00:05:02,920
They say old soldiers fade away...

52
00:05:03,390 --> 00:05:07,480
but I can hardly turn down a youngster
asking for a spot of guidance.

53
00:05:16,800 --> 00:05:18,460
<i>Its exoskeleton is so hard!</i>

54
00:05:22,150 --> 00:05:25,510
<i>And it strikes with tremendous power!
One false move, and I'm dead!</i>

55
00:05:32,070 --> 00:05:35,440
The way he's moving... No way is he E-Rank!

56
00:05:35,800 --> 00:05:38,150
Wh-What in the world is he?

57
00:05:39,730 --> 00:05:42,490
Wait... Did he fake his ranking?

58
00:05:42,970 --> 00:05:44,750
<i>I've heard the rumors.</i>

59
00:05:44,750 --> 00:05:49,390
<i>Rare individuals can control their magic
power to register with a lower ranking—</i>

60
00:05:49,390 --> 00:05:52,200
<i>the hunters known as false rankers!</i>

61
00:05:52,860 --> 00:05:57,700
<i>And most of them are said to be
lunatics who kill for the fun of it!</i>

62
00:06:00,830 --> 00:06:03,650
What am I doing here?

63
00:06:03,650 --> 00:06:05,620
D-Dad...

64
00:06:11,260 --> 00:06:14,610
<i>Damn! Its exterior is too tough
for me to do any real damage!</i>

65
00:06:16,030 --> 00:06:19,650
<i>And if my fatigue gets any higher,
I'll start to slow down.</i>

66
00:06:20,330 --> 00:06:22,610
<i>I need to kill it before that happens!</i>

67
00:06:23,580 --> 00:06:28,030
<i>Paralysis and drain... This dagger's
special abilities will be the key!</i>

68
00:06:28,450 --> 00:06:30,490
<i>If I aim for a weak spot,
it should get through!</i>

69
00:06:30,490 --> 00:06:31,700
<i>There!</i>

70
00:06:37,150 --> 00:06:40,460
<i>Acid? That's a nasty surprise!</i>

71
00:06:41,270 --> 00:06:43,130
<i>Rock-solid armor and acidic spit...</i>

72
00:06:43,130 --> 00:06:45,680
<i>This eight-legged freak
is even worse than I thought.</i>

73
00:06:46,500 --> 00:06:48,890
<i>And the longer this goes on,
the worse off I'll be.</i>

74
00:06:49,780 --> 00:06:52,810
<i>I need to get up close,
regardless of the risk.</i>

75
00:06:53,410 --> 00:06:55,150
<i>My new skill, Dash...</i>

76
00:06:55,830 --> 00:06:58,400
<i>I can use this to get in, fast!</i>

77
00:07:11,870 --> 00:07:16,100
<i>If one hit won't cut it, then I'll keep going!</i>

78
00:07:17,750 --> 00:07:19,590
<i>S-So fast...</i>

79
00:07:19,900 --> 00:07:22,130
<i>But will he have enough
stamina to hang in there?</i>

80
00:07:22,990 --> 00:07:24,800
<i>What is he even trying to do?</i>

81
00:07:27,180 --> 00:07:28,470
<i>Faster...</i>

82
00:07:30,230 --> 00:07:31,880
<i>I have to go faster!</i>

83
00:07:34,030 --> 00:07:35,810
<i>Almost there!</i>

84
00:07:40,870 --> 00:07:41,930
Jinwoo!

85
00:08:00,180 --> 00:08:01,290
Jinwoo!

86
00:08:46,780 --> 00:08:51,560
<i>It's a good thing I sat on
those daily quest rewards.</i>

87
00:08:52,260 --> 00:08:54,480
<i>I would've had more trouble otherwise.</i>

88
00:08:56,800 --> 00:08:58,730
<i>I can't believe it...</i>

89
00:08:58,730 --> 00:09:01,310
<i>He really did beat a boss by himself!</i>

90
00:09:02,590 --> 00:09:07,110
<i>And there can be no other explanation!
He's a false ranker!</i>

91
00:09:07,830 --> 00:09:10,540
I wonder how much this'll go for...

92
00:09:11,070 --> 00:09:14,070
U-Um... B-Boss?

93
00:09:14,780 --> 00:09:18,020
Would you like me to carry
the essence stone for you?

94
00:09:18,020 --> 00:09:20,710
I'll handle the gear, too.

95
00:09:21,070 --> 00:09:24,650
Here's some water.
Please help yourself, Boss.

96
00:09:24,650 --> 00:09:26,140
U-Uh... Sure.

97
00:09:26,780 --> 00:09:28,460
<i>Why is he calling me that?</i>

98
00:09:28,810 --> 00:09:33,360
You rest up, boss!
I'll excavate the mana crystals!

99
00:09:34,810 --> 00:09:37,410
<i>What the heck's gotten into him?</i>

100
00:09:39,560 --> 00:09:41,480
Huh... They're alive.

101
00:10:01,670 --> 00:10:03,230
Are you all right?

102
00:10:03,230 --> 00:10:06,210
Yes, sir. Thank you for the lesson.

103
00:10:06,550 --> 00:10:09,560
I should be thanking you.
This really was just what I needed.

104
00:10:09,900 --> 00:10:11,420
I appreciate it.

105
00:10:11,840 --> 00:10:15,610
I'm impressed, Chairman.
You don't seem to have lost a step.

106
00:10:15,610 --> 00:10:19,390
No, compared to when I was on active duty...

107
00:10:20,070 --> 00:10:23,230
You've gotten better
at defense yourself, Jinchul.

108
00:10:23,230 --> 00:10:25,130
It shows you've kept up your practice.

109
00:10:25,130 --> 00:10:27,140
Training might not raise your rank,

110
00:10:27,140 --> 00:10:30,730
but you can always hone
your body and technique.

111
00:10:32,110 --> 00:10:34,350
It's important to work
on one's body and mind,

112
00:10:34,350 --> 00:10:37,190
instead of relying solely
on your hunter powers.

113
00:10:37,190 --> 00:10:41,060
Especially if you regularly find yourself
in extreme situations like dungeons.

114
00:10:41,730 --> 00:10:48,090
It's at times like those when human nature
can rear its ugly head.

115
00:10:48,590 --> 00:10:50,390
Is the freaking boss dead?

116
00:10:50,390 --> 00:10:53,800
I guess it was just an overgrown spider?
What a joke.

117
00:10:53,800 --> 00:10:57,570
Maybe that gear was enough
to beat a C-Rank boss with.

118
00:10:57,570 --> 00:11:01,520
But in the hands of a D-Rank...
Just how weak was this thing?

119
00:11:01,520 --> 00:11:04,000
What's the call, Mr. Dongsuk?

120
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:05,730
Ain't it obvious?

121
00:11:05,730 --> 00:11:07,080
Yoo Jinho!

122
00:11:07,830 --> 00:11:11,780
That fancy gear of yours got me curious,
and I'm impressed!

123
00:11:12,160 --> 00:11:17,070
Your old man's Yoo Myunghan,
the head of Yoojin Construction, right?

124
00:11:17,960 --> 00:11:19,930
Wh-What of it?

125
00:11:19,930 --> 00:11:21,880
I'm giving you a chance!

126
00:11:22,370 --> 00:11:24,330
Kill Sung Jinwoo.

127
00:11:26,050 --> 00:11:27,910
You've figured it out by now, right?

128
00:11:27,910 --> 00:11:33,130
We pick up wastes of space to round out our
numbers, let them die, and keep all the loot.

129
00:11:33,130 --> 00:11:36,610
Jinho. You're gonna be an accomplice.

130
00:11:36,610 --> 00:11:38,590
That's the only way you're walking out alive.

131
00:11:38,590 --> 00:11:40,010
That's...

132
00:11:40,370 --> 00:11:44,520
<i>That trust fund kid's gear was
enough to take down a C-Rank...</i>

133
00:11:44,520 --> 00:11:46,630
<i>If it has special effects,
it could be a real pain.</i>

134
00:11:47,280 --> 00:11:51,020
Or if you'd prefer, you can both die here.

135
00:11:52,140 --> 00:11:55,210
What's up? Why hesitate?

136
00:11:55,210 --> 00:11:58,160
Nothing that happens here
is ever going to get out, anyway.

137
00:11:58,160 --> 00:12:01,960
Don't tell me a D-Rank like you
is afraid of an E-Rank like him...

138
00:12:21,000 --> 00:12:24,680
So you're siding with him?

139
00:12:27,910 --> 00:12:30,150
What now, Mr. Dongsuk?

140
00:12:30,150 --> 00:12:31,970
Deal with the weak one first.

141
00:12:32,840 --> 00:12:34,040
Have you boys...

142
00:12:34,800 --> 00:12:38,150
ever killed a human before?

143
00:12:42,950 --> 00:12:44,530
<i>An urgent quest?</i>

144
00:12:45,040 --> 00:12:46,680
<i>What the hell?</i>

145
00:12:47,410 --> 00:12:50,670
You're gonna wanna pay attention!

146
00:12:58,290 --> 00:12:59,400
Boss!

147
00:13:05,140 --> 00:13:06,460
Heejin!

148
00:13:09,850 --> 00:13:11,810
It's been a while.

149
00:13:11,810 --> 00:13:14,800
How have things been with
the White Tiger Guild lately?

150
00:13:14,800 --> 00:13:17,930
Nothing special, really.
Just the usual business.

151
00:13:17,930 --> 00:13:20,120
What about the Hunters Guild, Gina?

152
00:13:20,120 --> 00:13:22,880
Same for us, really. Just normal stuff.

153
00:13:23,280 --> 00:13:28,270
You mentioned you were going to start
A-Rank dungeon training with Ms. Cha.

154
00:13:28,270 --> 00:13:29,750
How'd that go?

155
00:13:29,750 --> 00:13:31,420
It was really something...

156
00:13:31,420 --> 00:13:32,920
Something fast.

157
00:13:33,360 --> 00:13:36,640
We were all struggling against
an A-Rank beast...

158
00:13:41,430 --> 00:13:43,390
But she defeated it in a flash.

159
00:13:44,390 --> 00:13:47,220
She made it look extremely easy.

160
00:13:47,220 --> 00:13:52,180
We were all pretty surprised,
but Kihoon was completely bowled over.

161
00:13:53,200 --> 00:13:56,420
He'd been hoping to become the next
strike team captain, you see.

162
00:13:56,420 --> 00:13:58,330
He is pretty straight-laced, yeah.

163
00:13:58,330 --> 00:14:00,510
What about Chul in your guild?

164
00:14:00,510 --> 00:14:03,250
He's after the same kind of position, right?

165
00:14:03,590 --> 00:14:06,140
He's... not a bad guy or anything...

166
00:14:06,140 --> 00:14:08,980
The fact that you said it
like that tells us everything.

167
00:14:09,410 --> 00:14:12,870
Well, be that as it may, we're pretty lucky.

168
00:14:12,870 --> 00:14:17,360
The Hunters Guild and the White Tiger Guild...
We're in the big leagues.

169
00:14:17,360 --> 00:14:18,810
You've got a point there.

170
00:14:19,840 --> 00:14:24,310
You hear plenty of unsavory rumors
about a lot of places out there.

171
00:14:24,670 --> 00:14:26,250
Like what?

172
00:14:26,760 --> 00:14:31,010
Strike teams with suspiciously
high fatality rates, for instance.

173
00:14:34,350 --> 00:14:37,190
Yoo Jinho! He's dead.

174
00:14:39,030 --> 00:14:40,440
How could you?

175
00:14:43,000 --> 00:14:45,120
<i>How could I have forgotten?</i>

176
00:14:45,780 --> 00:14:49,030
<i>I work in a world where survival
of the fittest is the reality.</i>

177
00:14:49,590 --> 00:14:53,200
<i>A world filled with violence,
deception, and betrayal.</i>

178
00:14:54,120 --> 00:14:55,400
<i>How could I...?</i>

179
00:14:55,880 --> 00:14:58,710
<i>How? How? How...?</i>

180
00:14:58,710 --> 00:15:04,510
<i>How? How? How? How? How?</i>

181
00:15:05,680 --> 00:15:08,680
<i>That's it. I'd grown numb to it.</i>

182
00:15:09,420 --> 00:15:13,570
<i>Carelessness. Overconfidence. Delusion.</i>

183
00:15:16,070 --> 00:15:17,440
<i>Enemies...</i>

184
00:15:17,810 --> 00:15:21,300
<i>The system is telling me to kill.</i>

185
00:15:22,470 --> 00:15:25,040
<i>Does it need to keep me alive
for some reason?</i>

186
00:15:26,590 --> 00:15:29,250
<i>This isn't a coincidence. It's not charity.</i>

187
00:15:30,560 --> 00:15:33,400
<i>The system wants me alive.</i>

188
00:15:37,870 --> 00:15:39,720
<i>It wants me strong.</i>

189
00:15:40,890 --> 00:15:42,750
Boss! Thank goodness...

190
00:15:43,030 --> 00:15:45,580
Dude, he's alive.

191
00:15:47,470 --> 00:15:49,160
Okay, then.

192
00:15:51,010 --> 00:15:56,400
If the system wants to use me,
then I'll use it, too.

193
00:15:56,980 --> 00:15:59,790
Damn it, Kyuhwan. Don't hold back so much.

194
00:16:01,440 --> 00:16:02,970
I'd forgotten.

195
00:16:03,400 --> 00:16:07,610
The weak always get taken from.
That's how it works here.

196
00:16:07,610 --> 00:16:12,030
Hey, look! The Weakest Hunter
of All Mankind actually gets it!

197
00:16:12,630 --> 00:16:17,320
That means you guys understand
how it works, too, right?

198
00:16:17,830 --> 00:16:20,280
How what works?

199
00:16:20,280 --> 00:16:22,460
If you're hunters...

200
00:16:23,750 --> 00:16:27,840
then you're ready to be
preyed on yourselves, right?

201
00:16:29,300 --> 00:16:32,010
Let me handle this, Mr. Dongsuk.

202
00:16:32,010 --> 00:16:36,470
Look, buddy. You clearly don't
understand what's going on here.

203
00:16:36,900 --> 00:16:38,970
We should be ready to be preyed on?

204
00:16:38,970 --> 00:16:42,470
And what's a jumped-up
E-Rank like you gonna do?

205
00:16:42,470 --> 00:16:44,690
The Weakest Hunter of All—

206
00:16:57,130 --> 00:16:58,310
One down.

207
00:16:58,310 --> 00:16:59,850
J-Juntae!

208
00:16:59,850 --> 00:17:01,000
What the hell?

209
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:02,790
When did he draw that weapon?

210
00:17:02,790 --> 00:17:04,960
Where was he even hiding it?

211
00:17:04,960 --> 00:17:07,610
<i>Overconfidence aside, Juntae was D-Rank!</i>

212
00:17:07,960 --> 00:17:10,200
<i>How could an E-Rank manage to kill him?</i>

213
00:17:13,430 --> 00:17:15,720
<i>I just killed someone.</i>

214
00:17:16,070 --> 00:17:17,280
<i>A human being.</i>

215
00:17:17,930 --> 00:17:20,810
<i>Even if I was just obeying the system,</i>

216
00:17:21,480 --> 00:17:25,480
<i>I've... just murdered another person.</i>

217
00:17:26,570 --> 00:17:28,940
<i>But if I hadn't done it, I would've died.</i>

218
00:17:29,850 --> 00:17:31,980
<i>So I can't back down now.</i>

219
00:17:33,450 --> 00:17:36,580
<i>If only the strong get to survive, then...!</i>

220
00:17:37,330 --> 00:17:39,200
Go to hell!

221
00:17:49,590 --> 00:17:52,200
How's an E-Rank got moves like that?

222
00:17:52,700 --> 00:17:54,310
Son of a bitch...

223
00:17:59,310 --> 00:18:00,270
Kyuhwan!

224
00:18:00,270 --> 00:18:01,270
R-Right!

225
00:18:08,590 --> 00:18:09,860
Take this!

226
00:18:18,110 --> 00:18:19,200
He's so strong...

227
00:18:20,040 --> 00:18:24,170
He feels stronger now than when
he was fighting the dungeon boss.

228
00:18:24,170 --> 00:18:27,290
H-He took my entire team apart in seconds...

229
00:18:27,790 --> 00:18:29,880
Was he hiding his true strength?

230
00:18:29,880 --> 00:18:32,520
You beat the boss, didn't you?

231
00:18:33,470 --> 00:18:37,470
Well, I might be a C-Rank, too,
but you'll find I'm nothing like them!

232
00:18:37,930 --> 00:18:39,610
Reinforcement!

233
00:18:43,800 --> 00:18:45,910
<i>This guy may be a monster,</i>

234
00:18:45,910 --> 00:18:50,020
<i>but after fighting a boss and five hunters,
he can't be at full strength.</i>

235
00:18:50,320 --> 00:18:54,320
<i>The trick is in how fast he is,
and in his dagger's special abilities.</i>

236
00:18:54,660 --> 00:18:57,950
<i>But when I use the Reinforcement skill,
my body becomes as strong as steel!</i>

237
00:18:57,950 --> 00:19:00,740
<i>That knife of his won't affect me!</i>

238
00:19:06,090 --> 00:19:08,920
Mr. Hwang. You're strong.

239
00:19:10,060 --> 00:19:12,700
But I've got some bad news for you.

240
00:19:17,470 --> 00:19:21,110
I've been leveling up this entire time.

241
00:19:22,290 --> 00:19:24,770
<i>Wh-What just happened?</i>

242
00:19:24,770 --> 00:19:27,940
<i>He... He smashed me into the ground?</i>

243
00:19:28,460 --> 00:19:32,150
<i>There's no way in hell he's E-Rank!</i>

244
00:19:33,170 --> 00:19:35,250
H-Hang on! Don't kill me!

245
00:19:35,250 --> 00:19:37,790
You've gotta show mercy! I-I can pay you!

246
00:19:37,790 --> 00:19:41,700
The mana crystals and essence stones...
You can have the lot!

247
00:19:42,470 --> 00:19:45,500
I-Is that not enough for you?
I-In that case...

248
00:19:45,500 --> 00:19:48,170
I'll pay you double! Double what I was—

249
00:19:47,180 --> 00:19:48,170
Three times.

250
00:19:49,230 --> 00:19:51,940
You tried to kill me three times...

251
00:19:52,900 --> 00:19:54,670
and now you want mercy?

252
00:19:54,670 --> 00:19:58,760
D-Don't do it! Y-You won't get away with this!

253
00:19:59,300 --> 00:20:04,430
Weren't you the one who said nothing
that happens in a dungeon ever gets out?

254
00:20:05,430 --> 00:20:09,060
You little shit! Do you have
any idea who my brother—

255
00:20:24,710 --> 00:20:27,710
The boss is dead, so the dungeon's closing.
Let's get out of here.

256
00:20:34,880 --> 00:20:37,920
You mean to tell me that all the
C-Rank hunters died in action,

257
00:20:37,920 --> 00:20:43,500
and the only survivors were...
a D-Rank and an E-Rank?

258
00:20:43,500 --> 00:20:46,350
That's true. Well...

259
00:20:47,640 --> 00:20:48,560
You!

260
00:20:48,560 --> 00:20:49,810
Y-Yes?

261
00:20:49,810 --> 00:20:55,160
Your gear... That's the Maya Company's Kalion
Longsword! The one that just came out!

262
00:20:55,160 --> 00:20:56,780
Oh... Yeah.

263
00:20:57,120 --> 00:20:59,620
<i>I got rewarded for something like that, huh?</i>

264
00:20:57,510 --> 00:21:01,950
And that's Gredos's Royal Series!

265
00:20:59,990 --> 00:21:02,510
<i>The Murderous Intent skill...?</i>

266
00:21:03,690 --> 00:21:06,910
<i>It can cut all abilities in half, huh?</i>

267
00:21:06,910 --> 00:21:10,080
I see! Well, your equipment
explains your survival.

268
00:21:10,590 --> 00:21:13,320
You must've handled everything yourself,

269
00:21:13,320 --> 00:21:16,710
while this E-Rank probably hid to say safe.

270
00:21:18,770 --> 00:21:22,830
I appreciate your cooperation
after such an ordeal.

271
00:21:22,830 --> 00:21:24,790
That should be everything.

272
00:21:26,110 --> 00:21:27,470
E-Excuse me...

273
00:21:28,310 --> 00:21:31,940
B-Boss... Good work back there!

274
00:21:33,060 --> 00:21:34,160
Right.

275
00:21:41,090 --> 00:21:42,990
Is everything okay?

276
00:21:42,990 --> 00:21:44,020
I was just thinking...

277
00:21:45,680 --> 00:21:49,470
I'm glad I gave her that umbrella.
